========================================================================
PART 1  all 256 rulings from decide(situation(...))
========================================================================
  SHIP                      4/256
  ADD_STATE               113/256
  ADD_MATERIAL             64/256
  RESHAPE                  17/256
  CHANGE_GRANULARITY       16/256
  RAISE_BUDGET             23/256
  HARVEST_COUNTEREXAMPLE    4/256
  AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR         15/256

========================================================================
PART 2  algebraic model  act = (T1 + T2) mod 8
        T2 = ntz over bits AMB..REFUTED (SELF cleared by x+(x&128)); 0 if none
        T1 = 4 iff borrow of x-7 lands the lowest set bit at index >= 4:
             (BUILT=AMB=UNREAD=0 and NOTWIN=1 and any of HIDDEN/CAPPED/REFUTED/SELF)
          or (BUILT=AMB=UNREAD=1 and NOTWIN=0 and any of HIDDEN/CAPPED/REFUTED/SELF)
========================================================================
  model == decide on 256/256 bytes; mismatches: []
  (4 & ntz(x-7)) + ntz(x+(x&128)) mod 8 == decide on 256/256; mismatches: []
  job-invariance (bits 8-9 = 0..3): 0/256 bytes differ

