  AMB+UNREAD         -> ADD_STATE               wins: AMB
  AMB+NOTWIN         -> ADD_STATE               wins: AMB
  AMB+HIDDEN         -> ADD_STATE               wins: AMB
  AMB+CAPPED         -> ADD_STATE               wins: AMB
  AMB+REFUTED        -> ADD_STATE               wins: AMB
  AMB+SELF           -> ADD_STATE               wins: AMB
  UNREAD+NOTWIN      -> ADD_MATERIAL            wins: UNREAD
  UNREAD+HIDDEN      -> ADD_MATERIAL            wins: UNREAD
  UNREAD+CAPPED      -> ADD_MATERIAL            wins: UNREAD
  UNREAD+REFUTED     -> ADD_MATERIAL            wins: UNREAD
  UNREAD+SELF        -> ADD_MATERIAL            wins: UNREAD
  NOTWIN+HIDDEN      -> AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR        wins: NEITHER
  NOTWIN+CAPPED      -> AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR        wins: NEITHER
  NOTWIN+REFUTED     -> AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR        wins: NEITHER
  NOTWIN+SELF        -> AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR        wins: NEITHER
  HIDDEN+CAPPED      -> CHANGE_GRANULARITY      wins: HIDDEN
  HIDDEN+REFUTED     -> CHANGE_GRANULARITY      wins: HIDDEN
  HIDDEN+SELF        -> CHANGE_GRANULARITY      wins: HIDDEN
  CAPPED+REFUTED     -> RAISE_BUDGET            wins: CAPPED
  CAPPED+SELF        -> RAISE_BUDGET            wins: CAPPED
  REFUTED+SELF       -> HARVEST_COUNTEREXAMPLE  wins: REFUTED

